# Kavaron Turbodrone (a 2/3): "{T}: Target creature you control gets +1/+1 and gains haste until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery." Turn 1 it is cast off Black Lotus and is summoning sick until turn 3. Bot2's Memnite is not a creature Bot1 controls, so it is refused as a target. On turn 3 a Memnite (1/1) is cast, and with it on the stack the ability is refused though the target is fine (sorcery speed, CR 602.5d). Once it has resolved the ability goes on it: a 2/2 with haste that attacks the turn it came in, so Bot2 goes from 20 to 18, and the Turbodrone taps.

